<section class="page-hero container"><span class="eyebrow">TIDALWAVE / PROJECTS</span><h1>From a first idea<br>to what comes next<span>.</span></h1><p class="lead">Explore our software, browse the source, and download the latest releases.</p></section>
<section class="container directory"><div class="section-label"><span class="eyebrow">SOFTWARE & EXPERIMENTS</span><span class="quiet"><?= count($projects) ?> published projects</span></div>
